# 统一换行：文本文件用 LF；shell 脚本强制 LF（Windows clone 后仍可直接 bash 执行）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
cx text eol=lf
*.py text
*.ini text
*.md text
*.txt text
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.toml text
Dockerfile text
Makefile text

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
